{"step_index":460,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T20:09:50Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Update walkthrough.md with input-group alignment fix\"","EndLine":"115","Instruction":"\"Add note about input-group flex-wrap fix in walkthrough.md\"","ReplacementContent":"\"### 8. Smart Pharmacy Search & Autocomplete Upgrade\\n- **Multi-Branch Network**: `MedCare Pharmacy` and `Lazz Pharma` now have dedicated branches across **Mirpur**, **Dhanmondi**, and **Uttara** with full inventory (Napa, Seclo, Ace, Sergel, Maxpro, etc.) across 753 active stock records.\\n- **Smart Area Fallback**: In `GET /api/pharmacies`, if a user filters by an area (e.g., `Mirpur`) and searches for a pharmacy located in another area (or vice versa), the backend automatically discovers matching branches in other areas and displays a helpful banner instead of showing a blank \\\"No Pharmacies Found\\\" screen.\\n- **Live Debounced Typing**: The directory (`pharmacies.html`), price comparison (`price.html`), and hero search (`index.html`) now update automatically as the user types without requiring manual Enter or button clicks.\\n- **Unified Autocomplete Components**:\\n  - `setupMedicineAutocomplete`: Real-time medicine suggestions with generic name, strength, dosage form, and DGDA reference price.\\n  - `setupPharmacyAutocomplete`: Real-time pharmacy suggestions with area badge, address, and verification status.\\n- **Input Group Flex & Button Alignment Fix**: Resolved layout breakage where autocomplete wrappers caused Bootstrap `.input-group` elements to wrap search buttons or prepended icons to new lines. Symmetrized and perfectly aligned \\\"Select Area\\\", \\\"Filter by Medicine\\\", and \\\"Search Pharmacy Name\\\" across the directory toolbar.\\n\\n---\"","StartLine":"100","TargetContent":"\"### 8. Smart Pharmacy Search & Autocomplete Upgrade\\n- **Multi-Branch Network**: `MedCare Pharmacy` and `Lazz Pharma` now have dedicated branches across **Mirpur**, **Dhanmondi**, and **Uttara** with full inventory (Napa, Seclo, Ace, Sergel, Maxpro, etc.) across 753 active stock records.\\n- **Smart Area Fallback**: In `GET /api/pharmacies`, if a user filters by an area (e.g., `Mirpur`) and searches for a pharmacy located in another area (or vice versa), the backend automatically discovers matching branches in other areas and displays a helpful banner instead of showing a blank \\\"No Pharmacies Found\\\" screen.\\n- **Live Debounced Typing**: The directory (`pharmacies.html`), price comparison (`price.html`), and hero search (`index.html`) now update automatically as the user types without requiring manual Enter or button clicks.\\n- **Unified Autocomplete Components**:\\n  - `setupMedicineAutocomplete`: Real-time medicine suggestions with generic name, strength, dosage form, and DGDA reference price.\\n  - `setupPharmacyAutocomplete`: Real-time pharmacy suggestions with area badge, address, and verification status.\\n\\n---\"","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\216e255d-b8e0-4484-815a-117107eae7cd\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Update walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md with input alignment fix\""}}]}
